            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="8">End-bent pedestal: 30 in along the beam, from the 12-in backwall front to the 42-in cap front. Rear backwall face is adopted flush with the cap rear face. Vertical drawing proportions are schematic; live dimensions govern.</paragraph>
            <embed spacingafter="12">
                <canvas name="TypeFPier" title="Upright pier bearing elevation" unit="in" size="6.5 in; 4.8 in; scaletofit">
                    <include target="Library.Geometry" />
