                    <planecontainer origin="0.1,4.3,0" dir="1,0,0" normal="0,0,1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Longitudinal elevation | Span 1 left / Span 2 right | Not to scale</textvalue></planecontainer>
