        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="7">
            <link address="#CodeReferencesGeneral;paragraphreferenceindex">Code references and calculation backlinks</link>
        </paragraph>
        <stylerule applytoall="True" type="Any" />
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="8" level="0" id="paragraphrefreturn0021">
            <link address="#FenceWind.FWStrategyStep01;paragraphfwstrategy01">Code basis and calculation strategy</link>
        </paragraph>
        <stylerule type="AnyEquation" name="Required Input" texthighlight="#F7E6B9" />
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="16" spacingafter="4" fontweight="bold">D2 MPDB PEDESTRIAN BRIDGE</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7" background="#FFF8E9" fontweight="bold">GEOMETRY BASIS — Cap and wind datums derive from the selected Type F pad, 6-in pedestal and 36-in cap. Individual seat grades, separate plates, the retained wind envelope, terrain reference and gross pier-face width require final-detail confirmation.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="4" fontweight="bold">FENCE WIND AND PIER NODE LOADS</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4">Design basis: LRFD Bridge Design Specifications, 10th Edition (2024); FDOT Structures Manual, January 2026.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7" fontweight="bold">CALCULATION OVERVIEW</paragraph>
        <embed spacingafter="12">
            <table name="FWOverviewIntro" title="Section introduction" capture="False" colwidths="1:90, 2:430">
                <stylerule range="A1:B3" background="#EDF3F8" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 1, &quot;#1766A0&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 1, &quot;#CCD9E5&quot;);" />
                <stylerule range="A1:A3" fontweight="bold" />
                <row>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Objective</textvalue></c>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Determine the wind loads transferred to the intermediate pier.</textvalue></c>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Inputs</textvalue></c>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Fence geometry; tributary length; prescribed LRFD 13.8.2 fence pressure; bridge/direct-pier wind inputs.</textvalue></c>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Output</textvalue></c>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Concurrent cap forces and moments, plus separate direct wall loads.</textvalue></c>
                </row>
                <stylerule range="A1:B1" background="#F1F5FA" />
                <stylerule range="A2:B2" background="#FFF8E9" />
                <stylerule range="A3:B3" background="#EFF7F1" />
            </table>
        </embed>
        <embed spacingafter="6">
            <canvas name="FWReviewFlow" title="Solution approach and load path" unit="in" size="6.5 in; 2.2 in; scaletofit">
                <include target="Library.Geometry" />
                <lines pts="2.02, 1.67, 0; 4.470000000000001, 1.67, 0; 4.470000000000001, 2.09, 0; 2.02, 2.09, 0; 2.02, 1.67, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" />
                <planecontainer origin="2.12, 1.92, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Steps 1–2: Set up the model</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <planecontainer origin="2.12, 1.74, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Codes / geometry / tributary length</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <lines pts="0.18, 0.92, 0; 2.7800000000000002, 0.92, 0; 2.7800000000000002, 1.36, 0; 0.18, 1.36, 0; 0.18, 0.92, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" />
                <planecontainer origin="0.28, 1.1900000000000002, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Step 3: Fence load</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <planecontainer origin="0.28, 0.99, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>15 psf / projected face / resultants</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <lines pts="3.72, 0.92, 0; 6.32, 0.92, 0; 6.32, 1.36, 0; 3.72, 1.36, 0; 3.72, 0.92, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" />
                <planecontainer origin="3.8200000000000003, 1.1900000000000002, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Steps 4–5: Combine loads</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <planecontainer origin="3.8200000000000003, 0.99, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Concrete / fence / direct pier wind</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <lines pts="2.02, 0.1, 0; 4.470000000000001, 0.1, 0; 4.470000000000001, 0.59, 0; 2.02, 0.59, 0; 2.02, 0.1, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" />
                <planecontainer origin="2.12, 0.41999999999999993, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Steps 6–7: Transfer and check</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <planecontainer origin="2.12, 0.17, 0" dir="1, 0, 0" normal="0, 0, 1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" textcolor="#29333D"><textvalue>Node forces / moments / design handoff</textvalue></planecontainer>
                <arrowlines pts="2.7, 1.67, 0; 1.48, 1.36, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" endarrow="6; 3" />
                <arrowlines pts="2.78, 1.14, 0; 3.72, 1.14, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" endarrow="6; 3" />
                <arrowlines pts="5.02, 0.92, 0; 3.87, 0.59, 0" linecolor="#1766A0" linethickness="1" endarrow="6; 3" />
            </canvas>
        </embed>
        <embed spacingbefore="8" spacingafter="12">
            <table name="FWContentBox19" capture="False" colwidths="1:520">
                <stylerule range="A1:A3" background="#EFF7F1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 1, &quot;#6A9075&quot;);" />
                <stylerule range="A1" background="#DCECE0" fontweight="bold" />
                <row>
                    <textcell capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7" spacingbefore="8" fontweight="bold">CAP-REFERENCE RESULTS — SIMPLIFIED LRFD WIND COMPONENTS</paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <textcell capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7" level="1">
                            • Fence load uses the single
                            <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage16;paragraphprojectcoderef16C002">LRFD 13.8.2</link>
                            gross-surface pressure; no projected-solid aerodynamic fence branch is used.
                        </paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <textcell capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="7" level="1">
                            • For the qualifying girder bridge,
                            <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage10;paragraphprojectcoderef10C002">LRFD 3.8.1.2.3a</link>
                            is used in lieu of the plan-angle sweep: 100% transverse plus 25% longitudinal, applied simultaneously.
                        </paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
            </table>
        </embed>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="3" spacingbefore="4" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" keepwithnext="True">RESULTS PREVIEW | These are end results. The calculation execution begins at Step 1 below the strategy.</paragraph>
        <embed spacingafter="12">
            <table name="FWReviewSummary" title="Wind overview" capture="False" colwidths="1:220, 2:150, 3:150">
                <stylerule range="A1:C7" background="#EFF7F1" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 1, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 1, &quot;#B7C2CC&quot;);" />
                <stylerule range="A1:C1" background="#DCECE0" fontweight="bold" />
