            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" textcolor="#536575">Printed 2-7 | Source PDF page 75</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Governs exposure selection and supplies the amended gust factor used in bridge and direct-pier wind pressures.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: Exp_Cat; G_fac; G_f; K_Z_gov</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">SCOPE / REVIEW NOTE</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">The FDOT gust factor replaces the base LRFD gust table. Exposure remains a site/direction criterion.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage07;paragraphprojectcoderef07C002">Related: LRFD 3.8.1.1.5; Eq. 3.8.1.2.1-1</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage09;paragraphprojectcoderef09C002">Related: LRFD 3.8.1.2.1; Table 3.8.1.2.1-2</link>
            </paragraph>
