                <link address="#CodeReferencesGeneral;paragraphreferenceindex">Reference index</link>
            </paragraph>
        </section>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="1" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="0" pagebreakafter="break"> </paragraph>
        <section name="CodePage09" capture="True" hide="false">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="40" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" id="paragraphprojectcoderef09C002" textcolor="#155731" texthighlight="#DDEFE3">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage09;paragraphprojectcoderef09C002">REFERENCE 09 | LRFD 3.8.1.2.1; Table 3.8.1.2.1-2</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage09;paragraphprojectcoderef09C002">LRFD Bridge Design Specifications, 10th Edition (2024)</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" textcolor="#536575">Printed 3-53 | Source PDF page 110</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Supplies minimum exposure height and the applicable girder and substructure drag coefficients. Retains the requirement for simultaneous horizontal components.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: Z_calc; C_D; C_sub; K_Z_III</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">SCOPE / REVIEW NOTE</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">The unamended gust table is source context; the FDOT amendment governs the adopted gust factor.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">RETURN TO CALCULATIONS</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0004">C001 | 1.1. Bridge Geometry</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0006">C001 | 1.3. Structure Type and Coefficients</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0018">C001 | 5. WIND LOADS ON SUPERSTRUCTURE</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind.FWCodeBasis;paragraphfwcodec10">C002 | Design basis</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind;paragraphrefreturn0026">C002 | Wind acting directly on the pier</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#SuperstructureUplift.UpliftStrategyWork03;headingSuperstructureUplift3">C004 | Concurrent wind and bearing equilibrium (upstream basis)</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
