            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Supplies the prescribed pressure normal to the gross metal-fabric fence surface. C002 develops the global fence resultant and centroid; C004 receives those live loads.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: p_fence; w_fence; F_fence; M_fence; w_f_III; w_f_SIV</paragraph>
