            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#SuperstructureUplift.UpliftStrategyWork02;headingSuperstructureUplift2">C004 | Gravity classification and load combinations</link>
