                <link address="#CodeReferencesGeneral;paragraphreferenceindex">Reference index</link>
            </paragraph>
        </section>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="1" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="0" pagebreakafter="break"> </paragraph>
        <section name="CodePage04" capture="True" hide="false">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="40" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" id="paragraphprojectcoderef04C004" textcolor="#155731" texthighlight="#DDEFE3">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage04;paragraphprojectcoderef04C004">REFERENCE 04 | FDOT SDG Table 2.4.1-1</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage04;paragraphprojectcoderef04C004">FDOT Structures Manual, January 2026</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" textcolor="#536575">Printed 2-6 | Source PDF page 74</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">The Duval County row supplies the adopted Strength III design gust speed in C001 and C002. C004 receives the resulting live wind loads.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: V_III; P_Z_III; P_Z_SIV</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">RETURN TO CALCULATIONS</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0005">C001 | 1.2. Wind Speed and Exposure</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind.FWCodeBasis;paragraphfwcodec04">C002 | Design basis</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind.FWStrategyWork05;paragraphfwstrategywork05">C002 | Wind acting directly on the pier</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#SuperstructureUplift.UpliftStrategyWork03;headingSuperstructureUplift3">C004 | Concurrent wind and bearing equilibrium (upstream basis)</link>
            </paragraph>
