                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage06;paragraphprojectcoderef06C004">REFERENCE 06 | LRFD 3.8.1.1.2; Table 3.8.1.1.2-1</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage06;paragraphprojectcoderef06C004">LRFD Bridge Design Specifications, 10th Edition (2024)</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" textcolor="#536575">Printed 3-46 | Source PDF page 103</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Supports the retained wind speeds by limit state and the Strength III horizontal-wind input to C004. Service IV is not used in the current pier load sets.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: V_III; V_V; V_SI</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">SCOPE / REVIEW NOTE</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Read the base wind-speed provisions with the FDOT county-speed substitution.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage03;paragraphprojectcoderef03C004">Related: FDOT SDG 2.4.1.A</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">RETURN TO CALCULATIONS</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0005">C001 | 1.2. Wind Speed and Exposure</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure;paragraphrefreturn0007">C001 | 2. WIND SPEED BY LOAD COMBINATION</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind.FWCodeBasis;paragraphfwcodec05">C002 | Design basis</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#FenceWind;paragraphrefreturn0024">C002 | Wind acting directly on the pier</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#SuperstructureUplift.UpliftStrategyWork03;headingSuperstructureUplift3">C004 | Concurrent wind and bearing equilibrium (upstream basis)</link>
            </paragraph>
