            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Identifies the LRFD edition referenced by the adopted FDOT manual. Used with the RFQ governing-edition record.</paragraph>
