            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage25;paragraphprojectcoderef25C004">RFQ V6.0, Addendum 5</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" textcolor="#536575">Printed 101 | Source PDF page 101</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">USED FOR</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Redirects operational importance to the RFQ structural criteria rather than applying the general agency provision without the project amendment.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">Variables: η_bearing</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">SCOPE / REVIEW NOTE</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                Read with RFQ item 8 and
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage29;paragraphprojectcoderef29C004">FDOT SDG 2.10.B</link>
                .
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage24;paragraphprojectcoderef24C004">Related: RFQ structural criteria, item 8</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingbefore="4" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in">
                <link address="#CodeReferencesC004.CodePage29;paragraphprojectcoderef29C004">Related: FDOT SDG 2.10.B</link>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="10" spacingafter="0" leftindent="8.65 in" rightindent="0.25 in" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#154E79" texthighlight="#EAF1F7">RETURN TO CALCULATIONS</paragraph>
