        <section name="PierSourceModelRecord" capture="False" hide="false">
            <heading level="0" keepwithnext="True">Current pier source — response reconciliation, 9 October 2026</heading>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Geometry source: Pier Cap Design 10-9.html, generated 2026-10-09T22:19:21+00:00; case Pier_Fixed — XML analysis.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Report SHA-256: 7a9f48ce08bdc29f22a1b6717432dc363f0c2d8cec02ffbfc0a36bb7da39dee2</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Report-identified Pier_Fixed.XML SHA-256: a992aa331e11b4eb9bc426a3f811938a8f71b22b3300bae3431eb2931eaff9d8</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">The replacement report supersedes the earlier Pier_MinTip report. Cap geometry remains 48 × 36 × 230 in with four 20-in pipes at 60-in centers. The report is archived in tasks/T006/sources; the earlier exact report/model pair remains in tasks/T005/sources.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7" fontweight="bold" background="#FFF8E9">SOURCE LIMIT: the matching Pier_Fixed.XML is not available locally. The report identifies the revised analysis, but its bearing-row offsets and full input currency have not been independently verified. Retain the journal’s symmetric +/-10.50-in offsets pending the matching raw model.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">C005 was removed from the journal on 19 October 2026 (T014); the pier cap design record is CapDesignPier. BPAD contains geometry and source references; reinforcement details and design findings remain in the separate report and Excel review. The current cap-end detail allowance is 3 in; the former C005 (removed 19 October 2026) used an earlier 3.44-in input.</paragraph>
            <heading level="1" keepwithnext="True">Earlier verified model — historical comparison</heading>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">The following bearing mapping belongs only to the superseded Pier_MinTip.XML (SHA-256 cb094424ed16e60b16957ed84a62aea21533fb61671c58a27ca73a997eaf70e4). Its right-row Y = +10.14 in differed from the journal +10.50 in by 0.36 in; this is the typo identified for correction in response 02.</paragraph>
            <embed spacingbefore="8" spacingafter="12" leftindent="0">
                <table name="PierSourceBearingMap" capture="False" colwidths="1:120, 2:110, 3:110, 4:160, 5:160">
                    <stylerule range="A1:E5" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.7, &quot;#7189A6&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.35, &quot;#7189A6&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenColumns&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.35, &quot;#7189A6&quot;);" vertalign="Center" />
                    <stylerule range="A1:E1" background="#DCE7F3" fontweight="bold" />
                    <stylerule range="A2:E5" background="#F1F5FA" />
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bearing label</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bearing node</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Cap node</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>XML X (in)</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>XML Y (in)</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>1L</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>181</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>16</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>38.50</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>-10.50</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>2L</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>182</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>33</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>141.49</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>-10.50</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>1R</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>183</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>16</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>38.50</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>+10.14</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>2R</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>184</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>33</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>141.49</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>+10.14</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                </table>
            </embed>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Cap nodes 16/33 are the connections of the four bearing identities. Cap X starts at the first pile; add 25 in for cap-end stations. The old global XML Z = -497.01 in and the journal local zero use different datums. No equivalence with the revised XML is assumed.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">
                <link address="#BridgeGeometry_2Beam.PierCurrentGeometry">Current pier cap geometry</link>
            </paragraph>
        </section>
        <stylerule applytoall="True" type="Any" leftindent="0.25 in" spacingafter="4" />
        <stylerule type="AnyEquation" name="Required Input" texthighlight="#F7E6B9" />
        <heading level="0" keepwithnext="True">Entry Reference - Pier</heading>
        <section name="FBMPEntryReference" capture="False" hide="false" pagebreakafter="break">
            <section name="FECalculationDefinitions" capture="False" hide="true">
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_signT = If(FE_Tdirection == &quot;Toward B2 / B4&quot;,1,-1)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_signT = If(FE_Tdirection == "Toward B2 / B4",1,-1)</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 1</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_signL = If(FE_Ldirection == &quot;Toward End Bent 2&quot;,1,-1)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_signL = If(FE_Ldirection == "Toward End Bent 2",1,-1)</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 1</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_U_F=1 kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_U_F=1 kip</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_U_M=If(FE_MomentUnits==&quot;kip-in&quot;, 1 kip*in, 1 kip*ft)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_U_M=If(FE_MomentUnits=="kip-in", 1 kip*in, 1 kip*ft)</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 1 kip*ft</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_zeroF=0 kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_zeroF=0 kip</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_zeroM=0 kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_zeroM=0 kip*ft</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_h=1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_h=1</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_tolF=1E-06 kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_tolF=1E-06 kip</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_tolM=1E-06 kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_tolM=1E-06 kip*ft</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_rowSpacing=2*NB_k to in" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_rowSpacing=2*NB_k to in</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 21 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_spanSpacing=NB_s to ft in" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_spanSpacing=NB_s to ft in</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 8 ft 7 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_Zbearing = FE_axisV*AX_Base_FE_Zbearing" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_Zbearing = FE_axisV*AX_Base_FE_Zbearing</expbody>
                        <expresult> = -2 ft 2.562 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_Node_B1=&quot;1L&quot;" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_Node_B1="1L"</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_Source_B1=&quot;Source B2&quot;" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_Source_B1="Source B2"</expbody>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_T_B1 = FE_axisT*AX_Base_FE_T_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_T_B1 = FE_axisT*AX_Base_FE_T_B1</expbody>
                        <expresult> = -4 ft 3.5 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_L_B1 = FE_axisL*AX_Base_FE_L_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_L_B1 = FE_axisL*AX_Base_FE_L_B1</expbody>
                        <expresult> = -0 ft 10.5 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_V_B1 = FE_axisV*AX_Base_FE_V_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_V_B1 = FE_axisV*AX_Base_FE_V_B1</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 0 ft 0 in</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_DC_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_DC_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B2 to kip</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 92.069 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_PL_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_PL_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B2 to kip</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 28.984 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_DW_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DW_B2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_DW_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DW_B2 to kip</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 0 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_DCbelow_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_sub_B2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_DCbelow_B1=PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_sub_B2 to kip</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 2.023 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_FT_W1_B1 = FE_axisT*AX_Base_FE_FT_W1_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_FT_W1_B1 = FE_axisT*AX_Base_FE_FT_W1_B1</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 13.167 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="0" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="0" keepwithnext="True">
                    <dynexp formula="FE_FL_W1_B1 = FE_axisL*AX_Base_FE_FL_W1_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                        <expbody>FE_FL_W1_B1 = FE_axisL*AX_Base_FE_FL_W1_B1</expbody>
                        <expresult> = 3.292 kip</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
