            </embed>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">These combinations collect the displayed DC, DW, pedestrian and structure-wind actions only. Other applicable project actions remain separate. Do not scale the Strength III wind set to obtain Service I: concrete and fence components have different limit-state treatment.</paragraph>
