        <heading level="0" keepwithnext="True">Entry Reference - End Bent</heading>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" background="#FFF8E9" fontweight="bold" spacingafter="10">CURRENT MODEL BASIS: the user confirms the cap report contains the latest FBMP model. Loaded nodes are 15 and 34; added model nodes changed their numbering. Physical axes, node-line choice, elevation and load-transfer conventions are retained. Both end bents follow the controlling End Bent 1 design. The different same-named Downloads XML is not the report source.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="16" spacingafter="8" leftindent="0" fontweight="bold">END BENT 1 | SPAN 1 | NODES 15 AND 34</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">Live superstructure DC / PL / W1–W3 inputs for the end bent beside the largest adjacent span. The current geometry selects the beginning-of-bridge end bent, beside the 107.35-ft span. Values follow the source journal’s simple-span, symmetric two-beam tributary model.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0" background="#F1F5FA" fontweight="bold">Separate load cases. Apply DC and PL once; each W row contains wind only. Select one matching wind set in each combination.</paragraph>
        <section name="EBControls" capture="False" hide="false">
            <section name="EBAxisOrientation" capture="False" hide="false">
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0">MATCH THE MODEL AXES</paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                    Positive transverse axis (+T):
                    <valuefield name="EB_AxisTChoice" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;Toward node 34&quot;, &quot;Toward node 15&quot;])"><textvalue>Toward node 34</textvalue></valuefield>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                    Positive longitudinal axis (+L):
                    <valuefield name="EB_AxisLChoice" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;Toward End Bent 2&quot;, &quot;Toward End Bent 1&quot;])"><textvalue>Toward End Bent 2</textvalue></valuefield>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                    Show wind case on schematic:
                    <valuefield name="EB_ViewCase" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;W1&quot;, &quot;W2&quot;, &quot;W3&quot;])"><textvalue>W1</textvalue></valuefield>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0" fontweight="bold">
                    Positive vertical axis (+V):
                    <dynexp formula="EB_VerticalLabel" style="Result only" mathlayout="off">
                        <expresult>Downward - into the plan</expresult>
                    </dynexp>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0" background="#F1F5FA">Blue = positive coordinate directions. Orange = physical wind. Nodes stay fixed. The vertical axis follows the two horizontal choices so all four views remain right-handed. Forces and right-hand-rule moments use the displayed axes.</paragraph>
            </section>
            <heading level="1" keepwithnext="True">Geometry, axes and entry controls</heading>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                Physical transverse wind:
                <valuefield name="EB_Tdirection" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;Toward node 34&quot;, &quot;Toward node 15&quot;])"><textvalue>Toward node 34</textvalue></valuefield>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                Physical longitudinal wind (W1 / W3):
                <valuefield name="EB_Ldirection" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;Toward End Bent 2&quot;, &quot;Toward End Bent 1&quot;])"><textvalue>Toward End Bent 1</textvalue></valuefield>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">
                Moment-entry units:
                <valuefield name="EB_MomentUnits" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;kip-ft&quot;, &quot;kip-in&quot;])"><textvalue>kip-ft</textvalue></valuefield>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EB_Node_near = 15" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False" style="Required Input">
                    <expbody>EB_Node_near = 15</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0">Bearing nearest the FBMP model origin (user supplied).</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EB_Node_far = 34" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False" style="Required Input">
                    <expbody>EB_Node_far = 34</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0">Other bearing (user supplied).</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EB_NodeV = 0 ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False" style="Required Input">
                    <expbody>EB_NodeV = 0 ft</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0">Physical node elevation input: positive down from the cap centroid, independent of axis view. The coordinate table converts it to the chosen V direction. Initial value follows the cap-centroid node convention.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EB_RowL = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,1,-1)*BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_bearingOffset to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False" style="Required Input">
                    <expbody>EB_RowL = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,1,-1)*BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_bearingOffset to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0.25 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0">Physical bearing row relative to the centered pile/cap line; positive toward End Bent 2. Linked to Bridge Geometry. The selected end determines which direction is toward the span.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" leftindent="0">The local origin stays at the cap centroid. Node 15 is the near-model-origin bearing, node 34 is the other bearing. Use the blue axes and live coordinate table to compare with the actual FBMP global directions; flipping a view does not swap node numbers.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6">
                FBMP application-node line:
                <valuefield name="EB_NodeLine" valuedef="FromOptionsOrValue(null, [&quot;At centered pile/cap line&quot;, &quot;At offset bearing row&quot;])"><textvalue>At centered pile/cap line</textvalue></valuefield>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="2">
                <dynexp formula="EB_NodeL = If(EB_NodeLine == &quot;At centered pile/cap line&quot;,0 ft,EB_RowL) to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_NodeL = If(EB_NodeLine == "At centered pile/cap line",0 ft,EB_RowL) to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6">Physical longitudinal coordinate of nodes 15 and 34. The node elevation remains the separate input above. Choose the line that matches the FBMP model.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="6" background="#F1F5FA">Offset counted once: at the bearing row, node coordinates carry the longitudinal eccentricity. At the centered pile/cap line, the entry table adds the corresponding moments. Node numbers remain 15 and 34 in both representations.</paragraph>
        </section>
        <section name="EBCalculationDefinitions" capture="False" hide="true">
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_SpanNumber = If(BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_1 &gt;= BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_2, 1, 2)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_SpanNumber = If(BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_1 &gt;= BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_2, 1, 2)</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 1</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_SelectedEnd = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1, &quot;End Bent 1 - Begin Bridge&quot;, &quot;End Bent 2 - End Bridge&quot;)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_SelectedEnd = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1, "End Bent 1 - Begin Bridge", "End Bent 2 - End Bridge")</expbody>
                    <expresult> = End Bent 1 - Begin Bridge</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_Span = Max(BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_1,BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_2) to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_Span = Max(BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_1,BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Span_2) to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 107.35 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_Trib = EB_Span/2 to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_Trib = EB_Span/2 to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 53.675 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_s = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_bearingSpacing to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_s = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_bearingSpacing to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 8.583 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_zb = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_BearingPlane_CapCG to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_zb = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBent_BearingPlane_CapCG to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 2.214 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_hc = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Dist_windSuperCG_CapCG-BridgeGeometry_2Beam.BearingPlane_CapCG to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_hc = BridgeGeometry_2Beam.Dist_windSuperCG_CapCG-BridgeGeometry_2Beam.BearingPlane_CapCG to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 3.542 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_hf = FenceWind.z_eff-BridgeGeometry_2Beam.BearingPlane_CapCG to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_hf = FenceWind.z_eff-BridgeGeometry_2Beam.BearingPlane_CapCG to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 11.930 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_zc = EB_zb+EB_hc to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_zc = EB_zb+EB_hc to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 5.755 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_zf = EB_zb+EB_hf to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_zf = EB_zb+EB_hf to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 14.143 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_e = C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure.e_V to ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_e = C001WindLoadOnPedBridgeSuperstructure.e_V to ft</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 3.396 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_signT = If(EB_Tdirection == &quot;Toward node 34&quot;,1,-1)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_signT = If(EB_Tdirection == "Toward node 34",1,-1)</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 1</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_signL = If(EB_Ldirection == &quot;Toward End Bent 2&quot;,1,-1)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_signL = If(EB_Ldirection == "Toward End Bent 2",1,-1)</expbody>
                    <expresult> = -1</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_U_F = 1 kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_U_F = 1 kip</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_U_M = If(EB_MomentUnits == &quot;kip-in&quot;,1 kip*in,1 kip*ft)" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_U_M = If(EB_MomentUnits == "kip-in",1 kip*in,1 kip*ft)</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 1 kip*ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_zeroF = 0 kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_zeroF = 0 kip</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_zeroM = 0 kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_zeroM = 0 kip*ft</expbody>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_T_near = EB_axisT*AX_Base_EB_T_near" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_T_near = EB_axisT*AX_Base_EB_T_near</expbody>
                    <expresult> = -4.292 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_T_far = EB_axisT*AX_Base_EB_T_far" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_T_far = EB_axisT*AX_Base_EB_T_far</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 4.292 ft</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_DC_near = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B2,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B4) to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_DC_near = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B2,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B4) to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 92.069 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_DC_far = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B3) to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_DC_far = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.DC_super_B3) to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 92.069 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_PL_near = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B2,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B4) to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_PL_near = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B2,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B4) to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 28.984 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_PL_far = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B3) to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_PL_far = If(EB_SpanNumber == 1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B1,PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.PL_B3) to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 28.984 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_DW_near = PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.w_DW_super*EB_Trib/2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_DW_near = PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.w_DW_super*EB_Trib/2 to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_DW_far = EB_DW_near to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_DW_far = EB_DW_near to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_TotalDC = EB_DC_near+EB_DC_far to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_TotalDC = EB_DC_near+EB_DC_far to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 184.137 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_TotalPL = EB_PL_near+EB_PL_far to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_TotalPL = EB_PL_near+EB_PL_far to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 57.969 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_TotalDW = EB_DW_near+EB_DW_far to kip" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_TotalDW = EB_DW_near+EB_DW_far to kip</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0 kip</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="2" leftindent="0" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="False">
                <dynexp formula="EB_gammaConcrete = PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.I29 to kip/ft^3" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EB_gammaConcrete = PedBridgeWeights_2Beams.I29 to kip/ft^3</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0.15 kip/ft^3</expresult>
