            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="6">Geometry link: rear-face inset + backwall thickness + beam-end gap + bearing setback minus half the cap width. Pile line is centered; bearing line is toward the span. The pedestal occupies 30 in from the backwall front to the cap front; vertical proportions are schematic.</paragraph>
        </section>
