                        <textcell capture="False">
                            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="3">Both end bents follow the controlling End Bent 1 configuration by user direction; shared dimensions are in Bridge Geometry.</paragraph>
                        </textcell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Analysis</textvalue></c>
                        <textcell capture="False">
                            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="3">Latest model per user: End Bent 1 controls the common design. Independent envelope maxima are not a concurrent action vector.</paragraph>
                        </textcell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Design status</textvalue></c>
                        <textcell capture="False">
                            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="3">Original report: 0 failed scalar checks, 48 pending/conditional checks. Current dispositions below exclude Service III and record field-adjusted U hooks; source results have not been rerun.</paragraph>
                        </textcell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Source</textvalue></c>
                        <textcell capture="False">
                            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="3">End bent 1 Cap Design Report_10-8.html; generated 2026-10-08T15:27:00+00:00.</paragraph>
                        </textcell>
                    </row>
                </table>
            </embed>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Source report SHA-256: 42120857965352febea29e4a672b2ba93f45199430360a89f8e1e529d2df50ef</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="8" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Recorded analysis XML SHA-256: 739f44c1d542464cfd536493ce1ed6cb240f98a75ed3e1188c6f6812742d6fe2</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">
                <link address="#BridgeGeometry_2Beam.EndBentCurrentGeometry">Shared cap and pile geometry</link>
            </paragraph>
