            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Continuous top bars, row 1; live from the current cap design (CapDesignEndBentOne).</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
