                    <expresult> = 4</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Continuous bottom bars at piles and between piles, row 1; live from CapDesignEndBentOne.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_bottomAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_P) to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_bottomAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_P) to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0.79 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Area of one continuous bottom bar.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_addedCount = CapDesignEndBentOne.n_B1" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_addedCount = CapDesignEndBentOne.n_B1</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 3</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Added span bars between piles, row 1, beyond the continuous bottom bars; hooked ends; live from CapDesignEndBentOne.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_addedAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_B) to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_addedAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_B) to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0.31 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Area of one added span bar.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_skinEachSide = CapDesignEndBentOne.n_skin" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_skinEachSide = CapDesignEndBentOne.n_skin</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 4</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Skin bars on each side, excluding top and bottom main bars; live from CapDesignEndBentOne.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_skinAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_skin) to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_skinAreaEach = CapDesignBasis.Ab(CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_skin) to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 0.44 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Area of one skin bar.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_AsTop = EBSteel_topCount*EBSteel_topAreaEach to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_AsTop = EBSteel_topCount*EBSteel_topAreaEach to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 2.2 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Top flexural area.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_AsPile = EBSteel_bottomCount*EBSteel_bottomAreaEach to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_AsPile = EBSteel_bottomCount*EBSteel_bottomAreaEach to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 3.16 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Continuous bottom flexural area at piles.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_AsSpan = EBSteel_AsPile+EBSteel_addedCount*EBSteel_addedAreaEach to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_AsSpan = EBSteel_AsPile+EBSteel_addedCount*EBSteel_addedAreaEach to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 4.09 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Combined between-pile bottom flexural area; additions are not the total.</paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="2" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
                <dynexp formula="EBSteel_AsSkinSide = EBSteel_skinEachSide*EBSteel_skinAreaEach to in^2" mathlayout="on" showsteps="False" seplines="False">
                    <expbody>EBSteel_AsSkinSide = EBSteel_skinEachSide*EBSteel_skinAreaEach to in^2</expbody>
                    <expresult> = 1.76 in^2</expresult>
                </dynexp>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Skin area per side; excluded from the report flexural areas.</paragraph>
            <embed spacingbefore="8" spacingafter="12" leftindent="0">
                <table name="EBLongitudinalSummary" capture="False" colwidths="1:150, 2:90, 3:90, 4:120">
                    <stylerule range="A1:D6" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.7, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.35, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenColumns&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.35, &quot;#6A9075&quot;);" vertalign="Center" />
                    <stylerule range="A1:D1" background="#DCECE0" fontweight="bold" />
                    <stylerule range="A2:D6" background="#EFF7F1" />
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Family</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bars (live)</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bar no. (live)</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Area (live)</textvalue></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Top</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.n_N1"><num>5</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_N1"><num>6</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="EBSteel_AsTop to in^2"><num>2.2 in^2</num></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bottom at piles (continuous)</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.n_P1"><num>4</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_P"><num>8</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="EBSteel_AsPile to in^2"><num>3.16 in^2</num></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Added span bars</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.n_B1"><num>3</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_B"><num>5</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="EBSteel_addedCount*EBSteel_addedAreaEach to in^2"><num>0.93 in^2</num></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Bottom between piles (total)</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>continuous + added</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>—</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="EBSteel_AsSpan to in^2"><num>4.09 in^2</num></c>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <c capture="False"><textvalue>Skin, each side</textvalue></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.n_skin"><num>4</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="CapDesignEndBentOne.Bar_skin"><num>6</num></c>
                        <c capture="False" formula="EBSteel_AsSkinSide to in^2"><num>1.76 in^2</num></c>
                    </row>
                </table>
            </embed>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">Additional top rows and second bottom rows are zero in the current case. The transverse schedule below is the 8 October record; the current actual station schedule is in the cap design report of CapDesignEndBentOne.</paragraph>
            <heading level="1" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">3. Actual transverse schedule</heading>
            <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" leftindent="0" spacingafter="7">All stations are inches from the left cap end. Each run uses #4 bars at 6-in pitch, global shear basis G: 19 closed hoops and 16 open-bottom U-bars. The source uses 90-degree U ends, 6-in tails and 3-in inside bend diameter. User direction: field bend the potentially interfering hooks to provide pile clearance. The table retains the original as-drawn screening; revised hook coordinates and development checks are not supplied.</paragraph>
