        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="16" spacingafter="5" fontweight="bold">D2 I-95 PEDESTRIAN BRIDGE</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="5" fontweight="bold">C006 — Pier Wall, Hairpins and Fin Plates</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5">Wall reinforcement • selected fin layout • plate resistance • weld-interface actions</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#A64A20" fontweight="bold">
            <dynexp formula="Status_C006" mathlayout="on" showformula="false" showidentifier="false" showresult="true">
                <expresult>PROVISIONAL — LOCAL CHECKS OPEN</expresult>
            </dynexp>
        </paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="5" fontweight="bold">CALCULATION OVERVIEW</paragraph>
        <embed spacingbefore="6" spacingafter="10">
            <table name="C006Box0" capture="False" colwidths="1:650">
                <stylerule range="A1:A4" background="#F1F5FA" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#7189A6&quot;);" />
                <stylerule range="A1" background="#DCE7F3" fontweight="bold" />
                <row>
                    <textcell name="C006Box0R0" capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" fontweight="bold">OBJECTIVE / INPUTS / OUTPUT</paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <textcell name="C006Box0R1" capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5">Objective — Size the fin plates for wall gravity and designated hairpin yield force; check distributed wall reinforcement.</paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <textcell name="C006Box0R2" capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5">Inputs — Existing wall quantities, pile geometry, concrete/reinforcing properties, and direct-wall wind pressure. Plate layout and local detailing are selected here.</paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <textcell name="C006Box0R3" capture="False">
                        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5">Output — Selected plate and hairpin arrangement; wall checks; concurrent forces/moments at each fin root for a separate weld calculation.</paragraph>
                    </textcell>
                </row>
            </table>
        </embed>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#A64A20">No weld size, weld throat, electrode, weld resistance, or weld pass/fail is calculated. Local pipe-shell resistance and the atypical hairpin/saddle node require separate completion; a passing plate result does not close those items.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="5" keepwithnext="True" fontweight="bold">RESULTS PREVIEW — selected geometry and governing demand family</paragraph>
        <embed spacingafter="10">
            <table name="C006Table292" title="RESULTS PREVIEW — selected geometry and governing demand family" capture="False" colwidths="1:370, 2:280">
                <stylerule range="A1:B16" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.5, &quot;#6A9075&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.3, &quot;#BCCEC0&quot;);" />
                <stylerule range="A1:B1" background="#DCECE0" fontweight="bold" />
                <row>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Item</textvalue></c>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Live result</textvalue></c>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <c capture="False"><textvalue>Fin thickness</textvalue></c>
                    <c capture="False" formula="t_p to in"><num>1 in</num></c>
                </row>
                <row>
