        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5">For the paired negative-offset case at every row: Fx, Fy, Fz, My and Mz are unchanged; Mx changes sign. Do not combine independently enveloped components from unrelated cases.</paragraph>
