        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0.3 in" rightindent="0.3 in">C001 - Superstructure wind; C002 - Fence and pier wind; C003 - Temperature movement; C004 - Uplift and bearing reactions.</paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0.3 in" rightindent="0.3 in">Keep the References folder beside this journal. C001-C004 each have one reference module; this module holds the full index and references used outside those calculations. Shared excerpts reuse the same named external PDF.</paragraph>
