            <link address="#CodeReferencesC002.CodePage17;paragraphprojectcoderef17C002">17 | FDOT Structures Manual I.6.B.5 | Printed I-4</link>
        </paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0.3 in" rightindent="0.3 in">
            <link address="#CodeReferencesC003.CodePage18;paragraphprojectcoderef18C003">18 | FDOT SDG 2.7.1; Table 2.7.1-1 | Printed 2-15</link>
        </paragraph>
        <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingbefore="0" spacingafter="7" leftindent="0.3 in" rightindent="0.3 in">
            <link address="#CodeReferencesC003.CodePage19;paragraphprojectcoderef19C003">19 | FDOT SDG 6.3 - Temperature movement | Printed 6-1</link>
