  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="3" fontweight="bold" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">Fitted actual-cage coordinates (replace the reference cover formulas of the report)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="y_N1 = 4.130622863769531 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>y_N1 = 4.130622863769531 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>top row 1 from the top face</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="4" level="1"><dynexp formula="y_N2 = 8.130622863769531 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input"><expbody>y_N2 = 8.130622863769531 in</expbody></dynexp><break type="tab"/>top row 2 from the top face</paragraph>
