  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bar areas and diameters by bar number are the shared functions CapDesignBasis.Ab(k) and CapDesignBasis.Db(k) (shared journal value — CapDesignBasis); this report defines no bar table of its own.</paragraph>
