  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratio of each distilled check (stems) against the 1.0 limit. The stems are live formulas of the check ratios: a stem turns red when its ratio passes 1.0.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Check numbers: 1–3 flexure (N, P, B); 4–6 minimum steel (N, P, B); 7–9 tension-controlled strain (N, P, B); 10–12 Service I (N, P, B); 13 shear at S; 14 longitudinal tension at N; 15 longitudinal tension at P; 16 longitudinal tension at B; 17 minimum transverse steel at M; 18 transverse spacing; 19 face steel area, largest; 20 face bar spacing, largest; 21 hook development.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">Failing checks not recomputed here (tool): R2, R4, R6, R8 calculated anchorage / closure: AASHTO LRFD BDS, 10th ed. (2024) 5.10.2.1/.3, 5.10.8.2.6a/b/d. Bend 4.500/4.500 in; hook extension 9.000/9.000 in; midheight embedment 15.000/8.443 in.  CRSI Table 7-2: straight stirrup/tie hook extensions; automatic 9 in. Trial hook rotation: left +50°, right +50°. Rotated-hook anchorage is PENDING: verify 3D engagement of longitudinal bars and hook congestion. The rotation range is not a code allowance. Bar intersects embedded pile / clearance envelope. Keep the bottom open and shorten, raise or relocate the ends. Recomputed here and failing (tool): Actual face shrinkage / temperature spacing: D/C 2.938, End left · Vertical; End right · Vertical (tie).</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">The tool reports 47 PENDING items: 2 Service III and fatigue; 3 FDOT covers; 3 D-regions, end regions and the end grid; 39 actual-cage prerequisites behind the distilled checks (anchorage and closure, splices, load path).</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">Detailing and geometry flags: 42 pass, as reported by the tool.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">A distilled result of ✓ covers only the recomputed numerical checks; it is not design acceptance. Recalculate in Blockpad after any input change.</paragraph>
</report><report name="CapDesignPier" title="Pier Cap Design - Distilled" unit="in" pagesize="816,1056" margin="48,48,48,48" bordermargin="0,0,0,0" collapsemargins="False">
