        <expbody>T_th_N = 0.25*φ_v*0.126*λ*Sqrt(fc/(1 ksi))*(1 ksi)*(b*h)^2/(2*(b + h))*Sqrt(Max(0, 1 - N_N/(b*h)/(0.126*λ*Sqrt(fc/(1 ksi))*(1 ksi)))) to kip*ft</expbody>
