  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratio of each distilled check (stems) against the 1.0 limit. The stems are live formulas of the check ratios: a stem turns red when its ratio passes 1.0.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Check numbers: 1–3 flexure (N, P, B); 4–6 minimum steel (N, P, B); 7–9 tension-controlled strain (N, P, B); 10–12 Service I (N, P, B); 13 shear at S; 14 longitudinal tension at N; 15 longitudinal tension at P; 16 longitudinal tension at B; 17 minimum transverse steel at M; 18 transverse spacing; 19 face steel area, largest; 20 face bar spacing, largest; 21 hook development.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">Failing checks not recomputed here (tool): End U grid · pile envelope clearance: Conservative square pile envelope includes the current horizontal placement allowance, pile embedment and required clear gap, enlarged by bar radius. Review shape-specific and fabrication tolerances separately.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">The tool reports 67 PENDING items: 2 Service III and fatigue; 3 FDOT covers; 4 D-regions, end regions and the end grid; 58 actual-cage prerequisites behind the distilled checks (anchorage and closure, splices, load path).</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C" background="#F1F5FA">Detailing and geometry flags: 50 pass, as reported by the tool.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="9" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">A distilled result of ✓ covers only the recomputed numerical checks; it is not design acceptance. Recalculate in Blockpad after any input change.</paragraph>
</report><report name="ProjectInfo" title="Project Information" unit="in" pagesize="816,1056" margin="48,48,48,48" bordermargin="0,0,0,0" collapsemargins="False">
