  </section>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">Moment resistance at zero axial load (read from the notebook sweep)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_r_P0 = 282.67716171801567 kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>M_r_P0 = 282.67716171801567 kip*ft</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored moment resistance at zero axial load (splice comparison; Eq. 5.6.4.5-3) [from the notebook: interpolated on the notebook sweep at P = 0]</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="DC_splice = M_splice/M_r_P0" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>DC_splice = M_splice/M_r_P0</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.867</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Table 455-2 splice strength / pile phi Mn (INFO)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">8. Combined axial load and biaxial flexure (LRFD 5.6.4.5)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Governing record (record 2): Pu = 123.61 kip against 0.10 phi f'c Ag = 157.95 kip, so Eq. 5.6.4.5-3 applies.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="P_u_bi = P_u_2 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>P_u_bi = P_u_2 to kip</expbody>
      <expresult> = 123.610 kip</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored axial load of the record</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_ux_bi = Abs(M_2_2) to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_ux_bi = Abs(M_2_2) to kip*ft</expbody>
      <expresult> = 38.710 kip*ft</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">moment about the x axis</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_uy_bi = Abs(M_3_2) to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_uy_bi = Abs(M_3_2) to kip*ft</expbody>
      <expresult> = 95.230 kip*ft</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">moment about the y axis</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_rx = M_r_P0 to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_rx = M_r_P0 to kip*ft</expbody>
      <expresult> = 282.677 kip*ft</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">uniaxial factored moment resistance about x: pure flexure (P = 0), conservative</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_ry = M_rx to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_ry = M_rx to kip*ft</expbody>
      <expresult> = 282.677 kip*ft</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">about y (square section)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="DC_bi = M_ux_bi/M_rx + M_uy_bi/M_ry" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>DC_bi = M_ux_bi/M_rx + M_uy_bi/M_ry</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.474</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">D/C, Eq. 5.6.4.5-3</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True" pagebreakbefore="break">9. Resultant bending axis (strain compatibility at the demand angle)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">The demand moment is resisted about the axis of the resultant moment. The notebook sweeps the curve again with the section rotated by the folded angle alpha (0 to 45 degrees, the square being symmetric); the demand ray from the origin meets the phi-curve at (Pr, Mr) and D/C = Mu / Mr along the ray. The angle and that point are the notebook's (amber inputs); tan(alpha) = M_min / M_max proves the angle, and the check at c_gov below recomputes the section.</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="P_u_rs = P_u_3 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>P_u_rs = P_u_3 to kip</expbody>
      <expresult> = 120.240 kip</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored axial load of the record</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_u_rs = M_res_3 to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_u_rs = M_res_3 to kip*ft</expbody>
      <expresult> = 102.797 kip*ft</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">resultant moment of the record</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="alpha_rs = 22.121228334810954 deg" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>alpha_rs = 22.121228334810954 deg</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bending-axis angle of the resultant moment, from the notebook (folded to 0-45 deg)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="tan_rs = Tan(alpha_rs)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>tan_rs = Tan(alpha_rs)</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.406</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">tan alpha</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="r_rs = Min(Abs(M_2_3), Abs(M_3_3))/Max(Abs(M_2_3), Abs(M_3_3))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>r_rs = Min(Abs(M_2_3), Abs(M_3_3))/Max(Abs(M_2_3), Abs(M_3_3))</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.406</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">M_min / M_max of the record (equals tan alpha)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="sn_r = Sin(alpha_rs)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>sn_r = Sin(alpha_rs)</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.377</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">sin of the bending-axis angle</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="cs_r = Sin(alpha_rs + (90 deg))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>cs_r = Sin(alpha_rs + (90 deg))</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.926</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">cos of the bending-axis angle</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="H_r = D_pile*(sn_r + cs_r) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>H_r = D_pile*(sn_r + cs_r) to in</expbody>
      <expresult> = 23.453 in</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">depth of the section normal to the bending axis</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="s_max_r = H_r/2 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>s_max_r = H_r/2 to in</expbody>
      <expresult> = 11.727 in</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">centroid to the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="t1_r = D_pile*sn_r to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>t1_r = D_pile*sn_r to in</expbody>
      <expresult> = 6.778 in</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">depth at which the compressed width stops growing</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="t2_r = D_pile*cs_r to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>t2_r = D_pile*cs_r to in</expbody>
      <expresult> = 16.675 in</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">depth at which the compressed width starts to shrink</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="q_r = sn_r*cs_r" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>q_r = sn_r*cs_r</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.349</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">sin x cos of the angle</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="s_st_r_1 = -sn_r*x_st_1 + cs_r*y_st_1 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>s_st_r_1 = -sn_r*x_st_1 + cs_r*y_st_1 to in</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="d_st_r_1 = s_max_r - s_st_r_1 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>d_st_r_1 = s_max_r - s_st_r_1 to in</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="d_t_r = Max(d_st_r_1, d_st_r_2, d_st_r_3, d_st_r_4, d_st_r_5, d_st_r_6, d_st_r_7, d_st_r_8, d_st_r_9, d_st_r_10, d_st_r_11, d_st_r_12) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>d_t_r = Max(d_st_r_1, d_st_r_2, d_st_r_3, d_st_r_4, d_st_r_5, d_st_r_6, d_st_r_7, d_st_r_8, d_st_r_9, d_st_r_10, d_st_r_11, d_st_r_12) to in</expbody>
      <expresult> = 18.893 in</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">depth of the extreme tension strand</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strands 2 to 12: the same equations, collapsed.</paragraph>
  <section name="Strands2toN_4" capture="False" hide="true">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_2 = -sn_r*x_st_2 + cs_r*y_st_2 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_2 = -sn_r*x_st_2 + cs_r*y_st_2 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_2 = s_max_r - s_st_r_2 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_2 = s_max_r - s_st_r_2 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_3 = -sn_r*x_st_3 + cs_r*y_st_3 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_3 = -sn_r*x_st_3 + cs_r*y_st_3 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_3 = s_max_r - s_st_r_3 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_3 = s_max_r - s_st_r_3 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_4 = -sn_r*x_st_4 + cs_r*y_st_4 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_4 = -sn_r*x_st_4 + cs_r*y_st_4 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_4 = s_max_r - s_st_r_4 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_4 = s_max_r - s_st_r_4 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_5 = -sn_r*x_st_5 + cs_r*y_st_5 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_5 = -sn_r*x_st_5 + cs_r*y_st_5 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_5 = s_max_r - s_st_r_5 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_5 = s_max_r - s_st_r_5 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_6 = -sn_r*x_st_6 + cs_r*y_st_6 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_6 = -sn_r*x_st_6 + cs_r*y_st_6 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_6 = s_max_r - s_st_r_6 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_6 = s_max_r - s_st_r_6 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_7 = -sn_r*x_st_7 + cs_r*y_st_7 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_7 = -sn_r*x_st_7 + cs_r*y_st_7 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_7 = s_max_r - s_st_r_7 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_7 = s_max_r - s_st_r_7 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_8 = -sn_r*x_st_8 + cs_r*y_st_8 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_8 = -sn_r*x_st_8 + cs_r*y_st_8 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_8 = s_max_r - s_st_r_8 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_8 = s_max_r - s_st_r_8 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_9 = -sn_r*x_st_9 + cs_r*y_st_9 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_9 = -sn_r*x_st_9 + cs_r*y_st_9 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_9 = s_max_r - s_st_r_9 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_9 = s_max_r - s_st_r_9 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_10 = -sn_r*x_st_10 + cs_r*y_st_10 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_10 = -sn_r*x_st_10 + cs_r*y_st_10 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_10 = s_max_r - s_st_r_10 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_10 = s_max_r - s_st_r_10 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_11 = -sn_r*x_st_11 + cs_r*y_st_11 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_11 = -sn_r*x_st_11 + cs_r*y_st_11 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_11 = s_max_r - s_st_r_11 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_11 = s_max_r - s_st_r_11 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="s_st_r_12 = -sn_r*x_st_12 + cs_r*y_st_12 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>s_st_r_12 = -sn_r*x_st_12 + cs_r*y_st_12 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand coordinate toward the compression face</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="d_st_r_12 = s_max_r - s_st_r_12 to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>d_st_r_12 = s_max_r - s_st_r_12 to in</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand depth from the extreme compression fiber</paragraph>
  </section>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="P_r_rs = 301.9308304614121 kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>P_r_rs = 301.9308304614121 kip</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">axial resistance where the ray meets the curve [from the notebook: where the demand ray meets the notebook curve]</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_r_rs = 258.13019395389944 kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>M_r_rs = 258.13019395389944 kip*ft</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">moment resistance where the ray meets the curve [from the notebook: where the demand ray meets the notebook curve]</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="lam_rs = (P_u_rs*P_r_rs/(1 kip^2) + M_u_rs*M_r_rs/(1 kip^2*ft^2))/((P_u_rs/(1 kip))^2 + (M_u_rs/(1 kip*ft))^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>lam_rs = (P_u_rs*P_r_rs/(1 kip^2) + M_u_rs*M_r_rs/(1 kip^2*ft^2))/((P_u_rs/(1 kip))^2 + (M_u_rs/(1 kip*ft))^2)</expbody>
      <expresult> = 2.511</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">projection of the capacity point on the ray</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="DC_ray = 1/lam_rs" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>DC_ray = 1/lam_rs</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.398</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">|demand| / |capacity| along the ray</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="DC_rs = If(M_u_rs &gt; 0.001 kip*ft, M_u_rs/M_r_rs, P_u_rs/P_r_rs)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>DC_rs = If(M_u_rs &gt; 0.001 kip*ft, M_u_rs/M_r_rs, P_u_rs/P_r_rs)</expbody>
      <expresult> = 0.398</expresult>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">D/C, resultant bending axis</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="12" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="6" keepwithnext="True">Check at the notebook's solved neutral-axis depth</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">The demand ray meets the notebook sweep between two neighbouring points; the neutral-axis depth there is interpolated. The sheet takes the notebook's depth c_gov as an input and evaluates the section exactly at c_gov (no interpolation between sweep points). The 121-point sweep itself is not written as formulas (see Section 7).</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="c_gov = 13.91089438993254 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>c_gov = 13.91089438993254 in</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">neutral-axis depth where the demand ray meets the resultant-axis curve, from the notebook</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="a_cg = Min(β_1*c_gov, H_r) to in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>a_cg = Min(β_1*c_gov, H_r) to in</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">compression block depth a = beta1 c, not beyond the section</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="A_b_cg = (Min(a_cg, t1_r)^2 + 2*t1_r*Max(a_cg - t1_r, 0 in) - Max(a_cg - t2_r, 0 in)^2)/(2*q_r) to in^2" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>A_b_cg = (Min(a_cg, t1_r)^2 + 2*t1_r*Max(a_cg - t1_r, 0 in) - Max(a_cg - t2_r, 0 in)^2)/(2*q_r) to in^2</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">compressed area</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="J_p_cg = Min(a_cg, t1_r)^3/3 + t1_r*(Max(a_cg, t1_r)^2 - t1_r^2)/2 to in^3" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>J_p_cg = Min(a_cg, t1_r)^3/3 + t1_r*(Max(a_cg, t1_r)^2 - t1_r^2)/2 to in^3</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">first moment, rising width</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="J_q_cg = (Max(a_cg, t2_r)^3 - t2_r^3)/3 - t2_r*(Max(a_cg, t2_r)^2 - t2_r^2)/2 to in^3" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>J_q_cg = (Max(a_cg, t2_r)^3 - t2_r^3)/3 - t2_r*(Max(a_cg, t2_r)^2 - t2_r^2)/2 to in^3</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">first moment, falling width</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="J_b_cg = (J_p_cg - J_q_cg)/q_r to in^3" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>J_b_cg = (J_p_cg - J_q_cg)/q_r to in^3</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">integral of depth times width over the block</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="eps_p_cg_1 = eps_pe + eps_ce + eps_cu*(d_st_r_1 - c_gov)/c_gov" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>eps_p_cg_1 = eps_pe + eps_ce + eps_cu*(d_st_r_1 - c_gov)/c_gov</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand strain</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="g_p_cg_1 = 0.025 + 0.975/(1 + (118*eps_p_cg_1)^10)^0.1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>g_p_cg_1 = 0.025 + 0.975/(1 + (118*eps_p_cg_1)^10)^0.1</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">power-formula factor</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="f_p_cg_1 = If(eps_p_cg_1 &gt; 0, Min(E_p*eps_p_cg_1*g_p_cg_1, f_pu), E_p*eps_p_cg_1) to ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>f_p_cg_1 = If(eps_p_cg_1 &gt; 0, Min(E_p*eps_p_cg_1*g_p_cg_1, f_pu), E_p*eps_p_cg_1) to ksi</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand stress, PCI power formula (tension) or Ep eps (compression)</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_f_cg1 = f_p_cg_1 + f_p_cg_2 + f_p_cg_3 + f_p_cg_4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_f_cg1 = f_p_cg_1 + f_p_cg_2 + f_p_cg_3 + f_p_cg_4</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_f_cg2 = S_f_cg1 + f_p_cg_5 + f_p_cg_6 + f_p_cg_7 + f_p_cg_8" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_f_cg2 = S_f_cg1 + f_p_cg_5 + f_p_cg_6 + f_p_cg_7 + f_p_cg_8</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_f_cg3 = S_f_cg2 + f_p_cg_9 + f_p_cg_10 + f_p_cg_11 + f_p_cg_12" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_f_cg3 = S_f_cg2 + f_p_cg_9 + f_p_cg_10 + f_p_cg_11 + f_p_cg_12</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_m_cg1 = f_p_cg_1*s_st_r_1 + f_p_cg_2*s_st_r_2 + f_p_cg_3*s_st_r_3 + f_p_cg_4*s_st_r_4" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_m_cg1 = f_p_cg_1*s_st_r_1 + f_p_cg_2*s_st_r_2 + f_p_cg_3*s_st_r_3 + f_p_cg_4*s_st_r_4</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_m_cg2 = S_m_cg1 + f_p_cg_5*s_st_r_5 + f_p_cg_6*s_st_r_6 + f_p_cg_7*s_st_r_7 + f_p_cg_8*s_st_r_8" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_m_cg2 = S_m_cg1 + f_p_cg_5*s_st_r_5 + f_p_cg_6*s_st_r_6 + f_p_cg_7*s_st_r_7 + f_p_cg_8*s_st_r_8</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="S_m_cg3 = S_m_cg2 + f_p_cg_9*s_st_r_9 + f_p_cg_10*s_st_r_10 + f_p_cg_11*s_st_r_11 + f_p_cg_12*s_st_r_12" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>S_m_cg3 = S_m_cg2 + f_p_cg_9*s_st_r_9 + f_p_cg_10*s_st_r_10 + f_p_cg_11*s_st_r_11 + f_p_cg_12*s_st_r_12</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="F_ps_cg = A_str*S_f_cg3 to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>F_ps_cg = A_str*S_f_cg3 to kip</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand force, tension positive</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_ps_cg = A_str*S_m_cg3 to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_ps_cg = A_str*S_m_cg3 to kip*ft</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">moment of the strand forces about the centroid</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="P_n_cg = Min(Max(0.85*fc*A_b_cg - F_ps_cg, -P_t_yield), P_n_max) to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>P_n_cg = Min(Max(0.85*fc*A_b_cg - F_ps_cg, -P_t_yield), P_n_max) to kip</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">nominal axial resistance</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_n_cg = 0.85*fc*(s_max_r*A_b_cg - J_b_cg) - M_ps_cg to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_n_cg = 0.85*fc*(s_max_r*A_b_cg - J_b_cg) - M_ps_cg to kip*ft</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">nominal moment</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="eps_t_cg = eps_cu*(d_t_r - c_gov)/c_gov" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>eps_t_cg = eps_cu*(d_t_r - c_gov)/c_gov</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">net tensile strain</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="phi_cg = Min(Max(phi_c + (phi_t - phi_c)*(eps_t_cg - 0.002)/0.003, phi_c), phi_t)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>phi_cg = Min(Max(phi_c + (phi_t - phi_c)*(eps_t_cg - 0.002)/0.003, phi_c), phi_t)</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">resistance factor, 5.5.4.2</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="P_r_cg = phi_cg*P_n_cg to kip" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>P_r_cg = phi_cg*P_n_cg to kip</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored axial resistance</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="M_r_cg = phi_cg*M_n_cg to kip*ft" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>M_r_cg = phi_cg*M_n_cg to kip*ft</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">factored moment resistance</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strands 2 to 12: the same equations, collapsed.</paragraph>
  <section name="Strands2toN_5" capture="False" hide="true">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="eps_p_cg_2 = eps_pe + eps_ce + eps_cu*(d_st_r_2 - c_gov)/c_gov" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>eps_p_cg_2 = eps_pe + eps_ce + eps_cu*(d_st_r_2 - c_gov)/c_gov</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">strand strain</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="g_p_cg_2 = 0.025 + 0.975/(1 + (118*eps_p_cg_2)^10)^0.1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>g_p_cg_2 = 0.025 + 0.975/(1 + (118*eps_p_cg_2)^10)^0.1</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">power-formula factor</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="f_p_cg_2 = If(eps_p_cg_2 &gt; 0, Min(E_p*eps_p_cg_2*g_p_cg_2, f_pu), E_p*eps_p_cg_2) to ksi" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>f_p_cg_2 = If(eps_p_cg_2 &gt; 0, Min(E_p*eps_p_cg_2*g_p_cg_2, f_pu), E_p*eps_p_cg_2) to ksi</expbody>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
